3. How does the code demonstrate polymorphism?
The function start_trip(vehicle) calls the same method, move(), on three different types of objects. Each object provides its own behavior: the car drives, the boat sails, and the drone flies. The classes do not share a parent class, so this demonstrates polymorphism through duck typing.